      "modify_from": "Transform two points along a top-face edge into world coordinates on that plane before deriving grasp yaw; an image-plane edge angle is not world yaw. Orient the hand straight down, roll approximately pi and pitch zero, with yaw aligned to the resulting world horizontal edge direction; maintain that orientation while carrying and releasing it.",
      "modify_to": "Transform two points along a top-face edge into world coordinates on that plane before deriving grasp yaw; an image-plane edge angle is not world yaw. Compute the edge's horizontal world angle with atan2(delta_y, delta_x), then choose its square-equivalent yaw modulo pi/2 in [-pi/4, pi/4), the representative nearest zero. Orient the hand straight down, roll approximately pi and pitch zero, with this canonical yaw; maintain that orientation throughout pickup, carrying, and release."
